## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- `double sma7_1 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_M15,7,0,MODE_SMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double sma21_1 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_M15,21,0,MODE_SMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double cci1 = iCCI(NULL,PERIOD_M15,5,PRICE_TYPICAL,1)`
- SMA cross: bar[1] cross up AND bar[2] was below (track last 2 bars)
- CCI zero cross: within ±1 bar of SMA cross (track sma_cross_bar, cci_cross_bar — accept if |diff| ≤ 1)
- Partial exit: track open lots; close 50% at TP1=entry+25pip; then monitor SMA7 trail for remainder
- SMA(84) and SMA(336) are structural context only — not used in entry signal directly; can be added as P3 filter
- P3 sweeps: SMA periods (5/7/10 cross 15/20/25), CCI period (3/5/8), TP1 (20/25/30 pips), add SMA84/336 trend filter

